    or Path C (migrate push-annotations to the op-log contract), then deletes `DocxAnnotationWriter` and
    `DocxAnnotation.TargetText` with zero remaining call sites. This is what makes I-5 (one byte-author) and I-7
    (no text-search anywhere) actually true, and is a prerequisite for Success Criterion 7 + task 060.
  </prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer — .NET 8 (ComposeService/ComposeEndpoints) + React/TS (Word-shuttle client). Understands the FR-24 push-annotations flow + the R4 op-log contract. Follow ADRs strictly.</role>
